You may use the tool, read the code, change it and learn from it, for free. You may keep modified copies for yourself, and you may fork the repository on GitHub to work on it.


ATTRIBUTION

Anything you release that includes or is built from this code must credit "Reactorcore" with the link https://linktr.ee/reactorcore somewhere a user can find it, such as a credits screen, an about page or the readme.


SELLING OR REDISTRIBUTING THE CODE

You may sell, or share publicly, something that includes this code only if you have drastically modified it, so that the result is a different product and not this tool with changes. Attribution still applies.

These count as drastically modified:
- A different kind of tool or a game, such as a city map generator built on this rendering code.
- A game or app that uses parts of this code as one component among its own systems.
- A rewrite in which most of the body types, the generation or the interface are your own work.

These do not count:
- Selling or re-uploading this tool as it is, or under another name.
- Changing the name, colours, branding, presets or interface and otherwise releasing the same tool.
- Adding a few body types, traits or features to the same tool.

If you are unsure, email reactorcoregames@gmail.com and ask.


